Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.24,0:23:59.25,Song ENG,,0,0,100,,{\blur0.7\bord0\c&HF3F2CE&\1a&H14&}The star shining far off in space...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.25,0:24:09.46,Song ENG,,0,0,100,,{\blur0.7\bord0\c&HE0EAC5&\1a&H14&}Amuro, it's your homeland where you were born
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.46,0:24:14.39,Song ENG,,0,0,100,,{\blur0.7\bord0\c&HE3E9C8&\1a&H00&\i0}Do you remember the days of your childhood?{\i1}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.39,0:24:19.02,Song ENG,,0,0,100,,{\blur0.7\bord0\c&HEBF4D2&\1a&H00&}The morning when you woke up in warmth?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.02,0:24:24.40,Song ENG,,0,0,100,,{\blur0.7\bord0\c&HECF3CA&\1a&H00&}Amuro, do not look back, Amuro...
